# ThreadSanitizer suppressions for the `USTORE_BUILD_SANITIZERS=thread` tree, which ctest passes to every suite.
# RocksDB builds uninstrumented, so its write-thread queues, group commits and arenas synchronize through atomics the
# sanitizer never sees, while the `memcpy`, `new` and `pthread_cond_*` calls they order are still intercepted.
race:rocksdb::
